WEBVTT

00:30:59.663 --> 00:31:04.454
You can't get entrenched when you're
really absolutely keen

00:31:04.454 --> 00:31:06.829
on understanding another species.

00:31:07.496 --> 00:31:12.579
So I guess going out into the wild then
forces you to to juxtapose what you think

00:31:12.579 --> 00:31:13.954
you know, against what is.

00:31:14.163 --> 00:31:15.996
Yes. And in a way of travelling around

00:31:15.996 --> 00:31:17.829
the world in all these
different countries

00:31:17.829 --> 00:31:21.704
and meeting all these different cultures.
It's kind of the same.

00:31:21.704 --> 00:31:25.663
You can't get entrenched in one culture
when you meet people behaving in

00:31:25.663 --> 00:31:29.079
a completely different way, maybe
from the same motives.

00:31:29.746 --> 00:31:32.496
You know, your mind is continually